---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Articles
description: Educational articles about speech and language development from SLPWOW clinicians.
permalink: /articles/
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="articles-heading">
  <h1 id="articles-heading">Articles</h1>
  <p>General education only — not individualized treatment advice.</p>
  {% if collections.articles.length %}
  <ul class="article-list">
    {% for post in collections.articles %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p>No articles published yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
